    {
      "source": "The appropriate SQL type as a String which should be used to represent the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLType.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>SQLType</code></a> in an\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Array.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Array</code></a>. Defaults to the name of the argument.",
