    {
      "source": "Translate the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>user type</code></a> of an array into the dialect-specific type.",
